1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
This video will explain to you how to make the knot of the cover effect at the bottom of the T-sheet flat.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
First, open the T-sheet project file.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
We are going to make a knot on the front side of the T-sheet.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Before making a knot, the particles of the board are set to 10.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
In addition, the knot is only on one side, so the left and right sides of the front and left sides must be removed first.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Ensure that the 3D window is shown on the surface of the pattern, and the right and left sides of the clear board are on the opposite side.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:53,000
In the position of the knot at the bottom of the T-sheet, draw a circle with a diameter of 200 mm with the internal tool.

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Add a small fixing pin at the bottom.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Open the T-sheet.

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Open the T-sheet.

11
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:14,000
In the simulation state, lift the T-sheet from the bottom of the T-sheet.

12
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
In the process of lifting, you can pull the T-sheet manually to prevent the position from penetrating.

13
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Close the simulation after removing the opposite side of the T-sheet.

14
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Switch to the T-sheet locking tool.

15
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Select the part of the inner circle.

16
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Come to the 3D window.

17
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Pull the grid of the inner circle out to a certain distance.

18
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Next, enlarge the diameter of the inner circle a little.

19
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:07,000
It can be enlarged to 210 mm.

20
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,000
The position can be slightly adjusted.

21
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Let the entire circle contain the fixing pin.

22
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Then select the inner circle line and add a elasticity to it.

23
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,000
The intensity of this elasticity is set to 90.

24
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,000
The proportion is set to 5.

25
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Then open the simulation.

26
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,000
After the simulation, the state is like this.

27
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Here is like a rubber band in reality.

28
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:39,000
The state of binding here.

29
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Delete the fixing pin inside the circle.

30
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Open the simulation.

31
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,000
You can see the reverse on the front.

32
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000
The part of the inner circle of the board has been tied.

33
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,000
Turn off the simulation.

34
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,000
This state can be presented.

35
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,000
Next, delete the fixing pin of the bottom row.

36
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Open the simulation again.

37
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:18,000
The simulation process can be adjusted appropriately by pulling with the small hand.

38
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:23,000
The back can be rearranged.

39
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Then simulate.

40
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:36,000
You can use the small hand to adjust the shape appropriately.

41
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:40,000
Finally, improve the quality of the clothing.

42
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:45,000
After the simulation, the effect of the front knot is presented.

43
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:51,000
If the board is a little shaky, you can sew the left and right sides of this circle.

44
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:58,000
Then simulate.

45
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:03,000
After the simulation is fine, close the simulation.

46
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:10,000
Finally, you can adjust the body to wear the T-shirt normally.

47
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:20,000
This T-shirt knot is made.

48
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:22,000
This T-shirt knot is made.

49
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,000
This T-shirt knot is made.

50
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:32,000
This T-shirt knot is made.

51
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,000
This T-shirt knot is finished.

52
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:45,000
This T-shirt knot can be pressed against long elements.

53
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,000
This T-shirt knot is bonus.

54
